  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "あたまに　ある　どくトゲで　えものを\nズブリ。よわったところを　１０ぽんの\nしょくしゅで　とらえ　とどめを　さす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "머리에 있는 독 가시로 먹이를\n찌른다. 약해졌을 때 10개의\n촉수로 잡아서 마무리한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "用頭上的毒刺扎進獵物身體。\n獵物變虛弱後，再用１０根觸手捉住\n並給予致命的一擊。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Les épines sur sa tête transpercent et\nempoisonnent l’ennemi. Ses dix tentacules\nse chargent ensuite du reste.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mit seinem Giftstachel am Kopf attackiert es\nBeute. Ist diese geschwächt, umschlingt es sie\nmit seinen zehn Tentakeln und gibt ihr den Rest.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Aturde a su presa con los aguijones venenosos\nde la cabeza. Cuando esta se debilita, la rodea\ncon sus diez extremidades y la remata.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Trafigge e indebolisce le prede con gli aculei\navvelenati sulla testa, per poi immobilizzarle\ncon i dieci tentacoli e infliggere il colpo di grazia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It plunges the poison spike on its head into its\nprey. When the prey has weakened, Mareanie\ndeals the finishing blow with its 10 tentacles.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "頭に　ある　毒トゲで　獲物を\nズブリ。　弱ったところを　１０本の\n触手で　捕らえ　止めを　刺す。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "用头上的毒刺扎猎物。\n在其虚弱的时候，\n用１０条触手抓住，一击毙命。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Aturde a su presa con los aguijones venenosos\nde la cabeza. Cuando esta se debilita, la rodea\ncon sus diez extremidades y la remata.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "かいていや　かいがんを　はいまわる。\nサニーゴの　あたまに　はえる\nサンゴが　だいこうぶつ　だぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "해저나 해안을 기어다닌다.\n코산호의 머리에서 자라는\n산호를 아주 좋아한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "牠會在海底和海岸爬來爬去。\n非常喜歡吃生長在太陽珊瑚\n頭上的珊瑚。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il rampe le long des fonds marins et des plages\nde sable. Les cornes de corail des Corayon sont\nses biscuits apéritifs préférés.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Kriecht auf dem Meeresgrund oder am Strand\nherum. Die Korallen, die auf den Köpfen von\nCorasonn wachsen, sind seine Leibspeise.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Reptan por las profundidades marinas o junto a\nla costa. Les encantan las ramas de coral que\ncrecen en la cabeza de los Corsola.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si aggira sui fondali marini e sulle spiagge.\nÈ ghiotto dei coralli che crescono sulla testa\ndei Corsola.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It’s found crawling on beaches and seafloors.\nThe coral that grows on Corsola’s head is as\ngood as a five-star banquet to this Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "海底や　海岸を　はいまわる。\nサニーゴの　頭に　生える\nサンゴが　大好物だぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在海底和海岸爬来爬去。\n生长在太阳珊瑚头上的\n珊瑚是它非常喜欢吃的东西。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Reptan por las profundidades marinas o junto a\nla costa. Les encantan las ramas de coral que\ncrecen en la cabeza de los Corsola.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "サニーゴのえだを　くうので　しぜんに\nおちた　えだを　あつめて　かこうする\nしょくにんたちに　にくまれている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "코산호의 가지를 먹기 때문에 자연스럽게\n떨어지는 가지를 모아 가공하는\n장인들의 미움을 받고 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "因為牠會吃太陽珊瑚的枝條，\n所以專門收集自然掉落的枝條\n來加工的工匠們很討厭牠。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son amour des cornes de Corayon lui vaut\nl’hostilité des artisans qui les récoltent dans\nla nature pour en faire des objets.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Die Arme von Corasonn sind seine Leibspeise.\nHandwerker, die natürlich abgefallene Arme von\nCorasonn verarbeiten, mögen sie deshalb nicht.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Los artesanos intentan exterminarlo porque se\ncome las ramas de los Corsola, que ellos solo\nrecogen al desprenderse de forma natural.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Poiché mangia i coralli dei Corsola, non è visto\ndi buon occhio dagli artigiani che raccolgono\ne lavorano i rametti caduti spontaneamente.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "They eat Corsola branches, so Mareanie are\nhated by craftsmen who work with Corsola\nbranches that have naturally fallen off.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "サニーゴの枝を　食うので　自然に\n落ちた　枝を　集めて　加工する\n職人たちに　憎まれている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "因为它会吃太阳珊瑚的枝，\n所以被收集自然掉落的枝\n来加工的匠人们所厌恶。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Los artesanos intentan exterminarlo porque se\ncome las ramas de los Corsola, que ellos solo\nrecogen al desprenderse de forma natural.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "あたま　いがいの　ばしょ　なら\nちぎれても　すぐに　さいせいする。\nひとばん　ねむれば　もとどおりだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "머리 이외의 곳이라면\n찢겨 나가더라도 금방 재생한다.\n하룻밤 자고 나면 원래대로 돌아온다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "如果是頭部以外的部位，\n就算被切碎也能立刻再生，\n只要睡一晚就能回復原狀。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Une nuit lui suffit à régénérer n’importe quelle\npartie de son corps, à l’exception de sa tête,\net ce, quelle que soit l’étendue des dégâts.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Bis auf den Kopf wachsen all seine Körperteile\nschnell nach, wenn sie abgetrennt werden.\nDafür muss es nur eine Nacht durchschlafen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Salvo la cabeza, cualquier parte del cuerpo que\nle arranquen es capaz de regenerarse en tan\nsolo una noche de descanso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "A condizione che la testa rimanga intatta, anche\nse gli staccano qualche pezzo si rigenera subito.\nDopo una notte di riposo ritorna come nuovo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Aside from its head, its body parts\nregenerate quickly if they’re cut off. After a\ngood night’s sleep, Mareanie is back to normal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "頭　以外の　場所　なら\nちぎれても　すぐに　再生する。\n一晩　眠れば　元通りだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "如果是头部以外的地方，\n即使切成碎片也能立刻再生。\n只要睡一晚就能恢复原样。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Salvo la cabeza, cualquier parte del cuerpo que\nle arranquen es capaz de regenerarse en tan\nsolo una noche de descanso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "トゲに　さされると　まず　しびれに\nおそわれ　やがて　かきむしりたくなる\nほどの　かゆみに　くるしむのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
