      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "要是被牠的毒刺給刺中，\n首先會發麻，接著會奇癢無比，\n讓人恨不得把皮都給抓爛。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ses piqûres causent un engourdissement qui\nse mue en démangeaisons si terribles qu’elles\npoussent la victime à se gratter jusqu’au sang.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Wird man von seinen Stacheln gestochen, setzt\nzunächst Taubheit ein, gefolgt von einem nahezu\nunerträglich starken Juckreiz.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La picadura de sus aguijones provoca un\nhormigueo que no tarda en convertirse en\nuna picazón insoportable.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Chi viene punto dai suoi aculei viene colto\nda un formicolio che diventa presto un prurito\ninsopportabile.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The first symptom of its sting is numbness.\nThe next is an itching sensation so intense that it’s\nimpossible to resist the urge to claw at your skin.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "棘に　刺されると　まず　痺れに\n襲われ　やがて　掻きむしりたくなる\nほどの　痒みに　苦しむのだ。",
      "language": {
